# Source for src/data/zork2/walkthrough.json -- run
# `node tools/build-walkthrough.js --game zork2` to regenerate it, and
# `node tools/verify-walkthrough.js --game zork2` to replay it against the
# real game (tools/play.js) and check every step's "done" condition fires.
#
# Same format as tools/walkthroughs/zork1.src (read its header), plus one
# more option for the verifier only:
#   wander   the step's result is random or timed (the Carousel Room, a
#            balloon that rises when it likes): the verifier walks back to
#            the step's room and tries again until it works, as a player would.
#
# The route collects all 400 points. Zork II's randomness (the Wizard's
# spells, the Carousel Room's spinning exits) means only some seeds play
# clean; the Wizard merely freezing or floating you is waited out.

## The barrow and the garden
INSIDE-BARROW | take lamp | A strangely familiar lantern | item=lamp
INSIDE-BARROW | take sword | You'll want something sharp too | item=sword
INSIDE-BARROW | south | The only way out is down the tunnel | arrive=NARROW-TUNNEL
NARROW-TUNNEL | south | Cross the foot bridge | arrive=FOOT-BRIDGE
FOOT-BRIDGE | south | Keep going | arrive=GREAT-CAVERN
GREAT-CAVERN | southwest | A narrow path among the stalagmites | arrive=SHALLOW-FORD
SHALLOW-FORD | south | Across the ford, into a tunnel | arrive=DARK-TUNNEL
DARK-TUNNEL | turn on lamp | It's getting dark | text=lamp is now on
DARK-TUNNEL | southeast | The narrow way leads somewhere pleasant | arrive=GARDEN-NORTH
GARDEN-NORTH | in | Something small and white in the rosebed | arrive=GAZEBO-ROOM
GAZEBO-ROOM | take teapot | Tea things on the table. You may need to carry water | cmd
GAZEBO-ROOM | take mat | A mat might be good for sliding things under things | cmd
GAZEBO-ROOM | take opener | A thin tool | cmd
GAZEBO-ROOM | take newspaper | Paper burns | cmd
GAZEBO-ROOM | take matchbook | And something to light it with | cmd
GAZEBO-ROOM | out | Back to the garden | arrive=GARDEN-NORTH
GARDEN-NORTH | south | Down the manicured path | arrive=FORMAL-GARDEN
FORMAL-GARDEN | south | Past the peculiar bushes | arrive=TOPIARY-ROOM
TOPIARY-ROOM | west | Through the rose arbor | arrive=CAROUSEL-ROOM

